<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-05T18:53:10.961Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 18:53:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue their month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the strategic al-Jawf mountain range. The Yemeni government accuses Iran’s IRGC and Hezbollah of sending 21 experts to support the Houthis, indicating heightened external involvement. Saudi airstrikes in Yemen killed seven people and the Saudi coalition reported downing a ballistic missile as the Houthis demanded $51 billion for a ceasefire, while Saudi forces also intercepted Houthi missiles aimed at Medina. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/05/yemen-president-sacks-ministers-and-officers-houthis&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOWmhYU0lVbnB0eXV5TF9sX19qM01PV0lWcXJCMDlGd1hLMm93WlJLa2J6V1UwNkhlSHRPcS15UU9TOFZPZlZ6RWJZM2pwMWg0dGlENWw4NXVvVFVld2dNM2dycVVkYUN2ZnRNT2d5c1gzLVcyWk5vX0lsd09MOTdnb3F5WlhHZ3VIVVg0OGFNMnpWUGFLeWYxYUVoeHBiY2hXRHctZUMwOWo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNclAwYXFkMFBGTlo4dTFsUkVDR0VrckJnSVM0Z2FTMXJkcW9mMVVVSEptYXV0Mm5Xc3NxcEhaR3JjcUs1Y08yMjU0Y2VzLVlVMGR6Yk03ZFdoQUtSY1RhVEdYbmVHcXR0N01jU1VvN2ZZZV9ocWk5TENlNmU2NjNZWmYwN2FkSVNuYWZKVXF2QVNhWHM3T0J0dGRvVVZaQUhYdzZPUmxTREpuSUcxR3BBTkVzbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9sX2xfQ2loRGdJMjdmZldmai1qVWVSXzF4OGZaVEQ4RFQ2QlU4WTR2ZG1scXYzekZpdzJlLXhXanZzajdGNHZnZkJBUGlpRjAxdl9RQUNWX18?oc